
# Step 1: Create Sample Data in Snowflake

Login to Snowflake and run:

```sql
CREATE OR REPLACE DATABASE ANKUR_DEMO;

USE DATABASE ANKUR_DEMO;

CREATE OR REPLACE SCHEMA PUBLIC;

USE SCHEMA PUBLIC;

CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE EMPLOYEE
(
    EMP_ID INTEGER,
    EMP_NAME STRING,
    SALARY NUMBER
);

INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES
(1,'JOHN',5000),
(2,'SMITH',6000),
(3,'DAVID',7000);
```

Verify:

```sql
SELECT * FROM EMPLOYEE;
```

Expected Output:

```text
1 JOHN 5000
2 SMITH 6000
3 DAVID 7000
```

