Paste:

```scala
import com.snowflake.snowpark._

val options = Map(
  "URL" -> "https://VQWOPXI-VB30682.snowflakecomputing.com",
  "USER" -> "ADF_USER",
  "PASSWORD" -> "Welcome@123",
