# Step 12: Insert Data Using Snowpark

```scala
session.sql(
"""
INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE
VALUES (4,'JAMES',8000)
"""
).collect()
```

Verify:

```scala
session.table("EMPLOYEE").show()
```

---

# Step 13: Execute SQL from Databricks

```scala
val result =
  session.sql(
    """
    SELECT EMP_NAME,SALARY
    FROM EMPLOYEE
    WHERE SALARY > 6000
    """
  )

result.show()
```

Output:

```text
DAVID 7000
JAMES 8000
```

